<title>HUNGARY: TENNIS-BUDAPEST OPEN WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BUDAPEST OPEN WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the</p>
<p>$107,500 Budapest Women's Open tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 7-Henrieta Nagyova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-1 6-7 6-2</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat 1-Karina Habsudova 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
